// Des: Tier 1 own GET: guarded, gzip-only, text-only, size-capped
// Flo: guard host > GET (conditional) > no auto redirect > head checks (type, size) > read body with cap > follow redirects by hand through the guard
// I/O: URL + Opts + Cond (caller) > Resp (status, body, etag, last-modified, retry-after); typed errors NeedVendor/NotText/TooBig/RedirectLoop/BlockedHost
